    "synopsis": {
        "native": "D\u00e9but du XXe si\u00e8cle, dans le nord de l\u2019Italie, \u00e0 Ughettera, berceau de la famille Ughetto. La vie dans cette r\u00e9gion \u00e9tant devenue tr\u00e8s difficile, les Ughetto r\u00eavent de tout recommencer \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9tranger. Selon la l\u00e9gende, Luigi Ughetto traverse alors les Alpes et entame une nouvelle vie en France, changeant \u00e0 jamais le destin de sa famille tant aim\u00e9e. Son petit-fils retrace ici leur histoire.",
        "english": "Early 20th century, Northern Italy. The Ughetto family, living through difficult times, dreams of a better future abroad. The story tells of Luigi Ughetto crossing the Alps to start a new life in France, thus changing the destiny of his beloved family forever. His grandson travels back in time revisiting their history, in an intimate dialogue with his grandmother Cesira."
